{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out to {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — integrative care that listens to the whole of you." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg1: #f6fbf9;
      --bg2: #eef7ff;
      --accent: #2b6a5b;
      --muted: #6b7280;
      --card: #ffffff;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      --soft: 18px;
      --radius: 14px;
      --shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(11,12,15,0.06);
      --maxw: 1100px;
      --accent-2: #6aa0d6;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
      color:#0f1724;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
      line-height:1.45;
      padding:32px 18px;
      display:flex;
      justify-content:center;
      align-items:flex-start;
    }
    .wrap{
      width:100%;
      max-width:var(--maxw);
      position:relative;
    }

    /* diagonal split hero */
    .hero{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1fr 460px;
      gap:28px;
      align-items:stretch;
    }
    .panel{
      background:var(--card);
      border-radius:var(--radius);
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      padding:28px;
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
    }
    .panel.left{
      padding:48px 40px;
      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 80% 100%, 0% 100%);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(43,106,91,0.06), rgba(106,160,214,0.04));
      min-height:260px;
      display:flex;
      flex-direction:column;
      justify-content:center;
    }
    .panel.right{ padding:26px; }

    h1{ margin:0 0 8px 0; font-size:28px; letter-spacing:-0.02em; }
    p.lead{ margin:0 0 20px 0; color:var(--muted); }

    nav{ display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:center; margin-bottom:18px; }
    nav a{ color:var(--muted); text-decoration:none; font-size:14px; }
    nav a.primary{ color:var(--accent); font-weight:600 }

    /* decorative svg pattern */
    .pattern{
      position:absolute; inset:0; pointer-events:none; opacity:0.12; transform:translateY(-10%);
    }

    /* contact card */
    .contact-card{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px }
    .meta{ display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center }
    .meta .pill{ background:var(--glass); padding:8px 12px; border-radius:999px; font-size:13px; color:var(--accent); }
    .meta .info{ color:var(--muted); font-size:14px }

    .form{ display:grid; gap:12px; margin-top:8px }
    .form-row{ display:flex; gap:10px }
    input, textarea, select{ font-size:15px; padding:12px 14px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid rgba(15,23,36,0.06); background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), rgba(255,255,255,0.5)); color:#081225 }
    textarea{ min-height:110px; resize:vertical }
    button{ background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent), #1f5e4f); color:white; border:0; padding:12px 16px; border-radius:10px; cursor:pointer; font-weight:600 }

    .aside{ font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.5), transparent); padding:14px; border-radius:10px }

    /* lower sections */
    .stack{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:18px; margin-top:22px }
    .card{ background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.9), rgba(250,251,253,0.7)); padding:18px; border-radius:12px; border:1px solid rgba(11,12,15,0.03) }
    .muted{ color:var(--muted) }

    footer.cta{ margin-top:28px; display:flex; gap:16px; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between }
    .cta-left{ color:var(--muted) }

    @media(max-width:980px){
      .hero{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
      .stack{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">

    <header style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:18px">
      <div>
        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="conditions.html">Concerns</a>
        <a href="approach.html" class="primary">Our Path</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="hero">
      <section class="panel left">
        <svg class="pattern" viewBox="0 0 800 600" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1" y1="0" y2="1">
              <stop offset="0" stop-color="#e6fff6" />
              <stop offset="1" stop-color="#eaf6ff" />
            </linearGradient>
            <pattern id="p" x="0" y="0" width="80" height="80" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(25)">
              <rect width="80" height="80" fill="url(#g1)"></rect>
              <g stroke="#d6eef0" stroke-width="1.4">
                <path d="M0 40 L80 40" />
                <path d="M40 0 L40 80" />
              </g>
            </pattern>
            <filter id="soft" x="-20%" y="-20%" width="140%" height="140%">
              <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="18" result="b" />
            </filter>
          </defs>
          <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p)" opacity="0.9"></rect>
          <g filter="url(#soft)">
            <circle cx="720" cy="-40" r="160" fill="#bfe3d6" opacity="0.45"></circle>
            <circle cx="-60" cy="600" r="200" fill="#cfe7ff" opacity="0.35"></circle>
          </g>
        </svg>

        <h1>Reach out. We listen to the whole of you.</h1>
        <p class="lead">A quiet conversation that becomes a plan — gentle guidance, practical steps, and events to gather and learn together.</p>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:auto">
          <div class="pill meta">
            <div class="pill">Events series</div>
          </div>
          <div class="muted">Join a monthly circle, workshops, and brief consults.</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside class="panel right contact-card">
        <div class="meta">
          <div style="flex:1">
            <div class="pill">Connect</div>
            <div class="info">Phone <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> • Email <strong>{{EMAIL}}</strong></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <form class="form" action="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" method="post" novalidate>
          <div class="form-row">
            <input name="name" type="text" placeholder="Your name" required />
            <input name="phone" type="tel" placeholder="Phone (optional)" />
          </div>
          <input name="email" type="email" placeholder="Email" required />
          <select name="inquiry">
            <option value="general">General question</option>
            <option value="events">Events / Workshops</option>
            <option value="consult">New patient consult</option>
            <option value="speaker">Speaking request</option>
          </select>
          <textarea name="message" placeholder="Briefly: what brings you here? (symptoms, goals, timeline)"></textarea>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
            <button type="submit">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
            <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">We respond within 3 business days. No guaranteed outcomes — education and whole-person support.</div>
          </div>
        </form>

        <div class="aside">
          <strong>{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</strong> {{CREDENTIALS}} • Based in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.  
          Our conversations include review of history, lifestyle, supportive practices, and optional lab education when appropriate.
        </div>
      </aside>
    </main>

    <section class="stack">
      <div class="card">
        <strong>First step: a careful listen</strong>
        <div class="muted">Intake is a structured conversation. We map symptoms, rhythms, environment, and meaning. For event-series attendees, this can be a short intake before a workshop.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <strong>Helpful, realistic plans</strong>
        <div class="muted">Plans include daily micro-habits, educational resources, and group learning. We avoid absolutes — success looks different for each person.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <strong>Educational labs & follow-ups</strong>
        <div class="muted">Optional labs are discussed as teaching tools. Follow-ups emphasize graded change and measurable comfort.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="panel" style="margin-top:22px; display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">Attend an upcoming circle</div>
          <div class="muted">Monthly gatherings and short courses — guided practices and Q&A.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
          <a href="book.html"><button style="background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--accent);color:var(--accent);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px">View events</button></a>
          <a href="pricing.html"><button style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent-2),var(--accent));">Pricing & plans</button></a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <div class="cta-left">
          <div style="font-weight:700">Prefer a quick note?</div>
          <div class="muted">Text or call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> — or send an email at <strong>{{EMAIL}}</strong>.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Please note: services are educational and supportive. We do not promise cures. For urgent medical needs, contact emergency services.</div>
      </div>
    </footer>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
"}
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Contact page — holistic_medicine (chunk 4)

This bundle contains two files for the contact page of the holistic / integrative medicine site.

Files included:
- contact.html — Full contact page built around a split-diagonal layout, inline SVG pattern, event-series emphasis, and the required sections (hero, diagnostic cues, plan, micro-habits, pricing teaser, CTA).

Placeholders to replace in contact.html:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}
- {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}
- {{CREDENTIALS}}

Notes & guidance:
- Visuals: the page uses inline SVG (pattern) and CSS gradients to keep the page self-contained — no external images, fonts, or CDNs.
- Layout: "split_diagonal" is expressed by a clipped left panel with an overlaid subtle SVG pattern.
- Voice: minimal_poetic — short evocative lines and calm language; avoids medical guarantees and emphasizes education and whole-person care.
- Offer model: events_series — the page references monthly circles, workshops, and short consults.
- Disclaimers: included near contact and footer; there are no promises of cures.

Customization:
- Replace placeholders with site data. The contact form posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}; update to your form handler or mail service.
- If you prefer the SVG pattern as a separate file, extract the <svg> from contact.html and save it to assets/img/pattern.svg; then reference it in CSS as a background-image.

Accessibility & legal:
- The form uses simple semantic inputs. Ensure server-side validation and spam protection before deployment.
- Keep the medical disclaimer visible and accurate for your jurisdiction.

